      "originalText": "SPARK DRIVER\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n1. get_env_variables(spark)\n2. Azure SDK: list_blobs(raw_data/)\n3. IncrementalTracker: watermark query\n4. spark.createDataFrame(new_blobs)\n5. .repartition(defaultParallelism)\n6. .rdd.mapPartitions(→ workers)\n7. batch_merge_results(→ tracking)",
