      "updated": 1783157707277,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "2. Apply semantic mapping and clean\nRename every mapped raw file_column to canonical schema_column.\nIf Date and Time columns exist, create Timestamp = to_datetime(Date + ' ' + Time).\nCoerce all columns from position 3 onward to numeric; invalid values become NaN.",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "2. Apply semantic mapping and clean\nRename every mapped raw file_column to canonical schema_column.\nIf Date and Time columns exist, create Timestamp = to_datetime(Date + ' ' + Time).\nCoerce all columns from position 3 onward to numeric; invalid values become NaN.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "index": "b2s"
    },
