      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 2073093632,
      "version": 147,
      "versionNonce": 1845312000,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1783157707277,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "3. Enrichment formulas\nEnergy Efficiency [%] = 1.48 * Faradaic Efficiency of CO / (Stack Voltage / 5)\nDelta p Anolyte [bar] = Anolyte inlet pressure - Anolyte outlet pressure\nCurrent density [mA/cm2] = 1000 * Current [A] / active_area_cm2\nSingle Pass Conversion Efficiency [%] = 100 * CO_formation_rate / CO2_inflow_rate\n  FECO = Faradaic Efficiency of CO / 100\n  CO_formation_rate = Current * FECO / (2 * 96485.3) mol/s\n  CO2_inflow_rate = (CO2 flow nlpm / 60 / 5) / 22.414 mol/s\nReplace +/- infinity with NaN after calculations.",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "3. Enrichment formulas\nEnergy Efficiency [%] = 1.48 * Faradaic Efficiency of CO / (Stack Voltage / 5)\nDelta p Anolyte [bar] = Anolyte inlet pressure - Anolyte outlet pressure\nCurrent density [mA/cm2] = 1000 * Current [A] / active_area_cm2\nSingle Pass Conversion Efficiency [%] = 100 * CO_formation_rate / CO2_inflow_rate\n  FECO = Faradaic Efficiency of CO / 100\n  CO_formation_rate = Current * FECO / (2 * 96485.3) mol/s\n  CO2_inflow_rate = (CO2 flow nlpm / 60 / 5) / 22.414 mol/s\nReplace +/- infinity with NaN after calculations.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "index": "b2u"
    },
